            "\\((k+1)I_k=I_{k+1}+e^{1/4}\\)"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
          "keyPoints": [
            {
              "text": "For \\(I_k=\\int_0^{1/4}x^ke^{-x}dx\\), which is the correct recurrence?",
