            "\\(I_{n+1}+I_1+\\frac{1-(1/4)^n}{12e^{1/4}}\\)",
            "\\(I_{n+1}-I_1-\\frac{1-(1/4)^n}{12e^{1/4}}\\)",
            "\\(\\sum_{k=1}^n kI_k=I_n-I_1\\)"
          ],
          "answer": 0,
